{"title":"Weird old men are destroying the country!","link":"https://www.garbageday.email/p/weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country","date":1741969651000,"content":"<div><div><p><i>Welcome to Garbage Weekend. It’s the internet garbage you know and love, but in a format that’s easier to read while you feel the sun on your skin for the first time in months.</i></p><div><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/e0294801-8678-454f-8ab0-fcf5ce4d8795/GettyImages-2204036172.jpg?t=1741963577\" /><div><span><p>(Photo by Jabin Botsford/The Washington Post via Getty Images)</p></span></div></div><p>This week, a <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/11/judge-orders-doge-document-release?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">federal judge ordered </a>the Department of Government Efficiency (DOGE) to comply with Freedom Of Information Act (FOIA) requests and release internal records, instead of acting like its vague, janky “receipts” (which are now <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/03/13/us/politics/doge-errors-funding-grants-claims.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">showing less and less information</a>, but still filled with mistakes) are up to government standards. Speaking of those, Sen. Chuck Schumer’s decision to <a href=\"https://x.com/SenSchumer/status/1900372500371910916?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">vote with the Republicans</a> has been received so badly he’s lost everyone on <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/jefftiedrich.bsky.social/post/3lkcdvyefls2h?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">Bluesky</a>, <a href=\"https://x.com/0liviajulianna/status/1900391287561331130?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">X</a>, and <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/jdcmedlock.bsky.social/post/3lkcmjxgbis2d?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">Reddit</a> — the three branches of government! Besides Schumer, other people it’s now too embarrassing to associate with include <a href=\"https://www.rollingstone.com/culture/culture-features/tesla-elon-musk-embarassed-disguise-car-1235294522/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">Tesla owners</a>, the <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/shoe.bsky.social/post/3lkc337d2ts24?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">politicians</a> you <a href=\"https://www.wpr.org/news/contentious-wisconsin-republicans-virtual-town-halls-van-orden?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">voted for</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.thedailybeast.com/gavin-newsoms-chummy-chat-with-steve-bannon-torched-by-dem-presidential-contender/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">Steve Bannon</a> (if you’re not Gov. Gavin Newsom, apparently). You can see why the <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/03/14/science/nasa-spacex-astronauts-iss-launch.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">first astronauts</a> to go to the International Space Station in months are so happy!</p><p>Oh well, here’s some fun stuff…</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/decamarks/777024807326908416/guy-in-front-of-me-has-spent-the-past-hour?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">A dedicated gamer</a> </p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/Criminalsimpson/status/1896690474620256762?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">Good mural</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/minmodulation/status/1900203700770980178?s=12&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">Sissy hypnosis can ruin lives</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/funkelly.bsky.social/post/3lixz44tvd22w?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">Million dollar idea</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/travisview.bsky.social/post/3ljxepiu6j224?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">A very rare Vance</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/youresodead/status/1899887064390234436?s=12&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">Sneaky poops</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/nikkiophan.bsky.social/post/3ljvuflhbks2e?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">Elon molly</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/03/06/style/charizard-cheeto-pokemon-auction.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">“A Cheeto Shaped Like The Pokemon Charizard Sells For Nearly $90,000”</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/celebrityhottub.bsky.social/post/3lk5jz6gj4k27?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">Gavin Newsom's next guest</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/easel-eisel/772159110046203904/you-should-probably-worry-about-the-wraith-as-well?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">The wraith</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/scrawnym4/777312561621336064/galacticnova3?source=share&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">The Bad Guy McWeirdson fandom</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/the-frightening-ghoul/777678124990218240?source=share&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\" target=\"_blank\">Tumblr’s frightening ghoul</a></p></li></ul><div><hr /><div><h2> Subscribe to Premium to read the rest. </h2><p> Become a paying subscriber of Premium to get access to this post and other subscriber-only content. </p><p><a href=\"https://www.garbageday.email/upgrade?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\">Upgrade</a> Translation missing: en.app.shared.conjuction.or <a href=\"https://www.garbageday.email/login?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weird-old-men-are-destroying-the-country\">Sign In</a></p><div><div><h3> A subscription gets you </h3></div><ul><li> Paywalled weekend issue </li><li> Monthly Garbage Intelligence report </li><li> Discord access </li><li> Discounts on merch and events </li></